\"merge_gap_seconds\" -> mergeGap,\n        \"minimum_region_seconds\" -> \
minimumDuration,\n        \"audible_coverage_fraction\" -> coverage,\n        \
\"regions\" -> regions\n    |>\n];\n\n"], "Input", InitializationCell -> 
